# COBOL: ISO/IEC 1989:2023 (reserved words, reference format) and IBM Enterprise COBOL Language Reference; requirements/languages/cobol.md
name     cobol cbl cob cpy

keyword  IDENTIFICATION ENVIRONMENT DATA PROCEDURE DIVISION SECTION PROGRAM-ID AUTHOR CONFIGURATION
keyword  INPUT-OUTPUT FILE-CONTROL FILE WORKING-STORAGE LOCAL-STORAGE LINKAGE FD SELECT ASSIGN TO PIC
keyword  PICTURE VALUE VALUES OCCURS TIMES REDEFINES USAGE COMP COMP-3 BINARY PACKED-DECIMAL MOVE ADD
keyword  SUBTRACT MULTIPLY DIVIDE COMPUTE GIVING REMAINDER INTO FROM BY IF THEN ELSE END-IF EVALUATE WHEN
keyword  OTHER END-EVALUATE PERFORM END-PERFORM UNTIL VARYING THRU THROUGH GO GOBACK STOP RUN CALL USING
keyword  RETURNING DISPLAY ACCEPT OPEN CLOSE READ WRITE REWRITE DELETE START AT END NOT INVALID KEY
keyword  STRING UNSTRING DELIMITED SIZE INSPECT TALLYING REPLACING INITIALIZE SET CONTINUE EXIT AND OR
keyword  IS EQUAL GREATER LESS THAN COPY REPLACE ROUNDED ON ERROR OVERFLOW
builtin  ZERO ZEROS ZEROES SPACE SPACES HIGH-VALUE HIGH-VALUES LOW-VALUE LOW-VALUES QUOTE QUOTES NULL
builtin  TRUE FALSE
fold-case

ident-part     -
line-comment   *>
string   " "  : doubled
string   ' '  : doubled
operators  +-*/=<>
hook     cobol
